\section{Aims of the Project}
\label{sec:aim}

The main research question in this project is ``\textbf{What kind of reduction in forecast error can be achieved \add{in Fugro's Gulf of Mexico ensemble wave forecasting system} by assimilating \comment{Hs, Tm01 and Tm02}{These should be symbols throughout the thesis. I.e. use math mode.} at a single buoy location using the ensemble transform Kalman filter method?}''

