To this end, \replace{we use the ensemble transform Kalman filter (ETKF) to assimilate observations of the three variables and examine the errors resulting from this as compared to the errors before any DA is applied. Measures of error that are examined are:}{we will conduct a twin experiment using a series of 7-day wave ensemble forecasts. In this twin experiment one of the ensemble members will be set apart as artificial truth and from its values at the buoy location artificial observations will be synthesized. After DA the ensemble mean will be compared with the artificial truth using three metrics:}  
